## roadmap

### priority (v0.1.0 gap)
- [] signing for security
- [] check signing
- [] base122 (in rust)
- [] mini http server variation
- [] reproducible builds/deterministic output
- [] json manifest block
- [] output allowed to overwrite input files with no warning
- [] backwards compatability with browsers
- [] threaded mode atomics unstable wasm can we add the headers
- [1/2] license (MIT + Apache-2.0 shipped, not final)
- [x] documentation on ordering of how the html is woven together
- [x] more ergonomic default runtime
- [x] basic errors and propagation
- [x] library api
- [x] test suite
- [x] LLM integration and tool calling
- [x] verbose description of what is happening
- [x] basic documentation

